; ========================================
; ＞『玄関ホール』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜正站在玄关大厅里。|#0102Adv25_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜，你在这做什么？|#0102Adv25_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是艾玛啊。<br>我刚刚在调查有没办法外出。|#0102Adv25_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:外出……？|#0102Adv25_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得，<br>凶手有可能是从外面进来的……|#0102Adv25_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜似乎有些难以启齿，<br>但艾玛一下子就想到了<br>她脑海里的怀疑对象是谁。|#0102Adv25_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（也许奈叶香从外面入侵，把米莉亚给……）|#0102Adv25_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（话说回来，<br>　我们甚至不知道奈叶香藏在哪里）|#0102Adv25_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（或许她一直躲在监牢里。<br>　然后找准时机——）|#0102Adv25_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用力摇了摇头。|#0102Adv25_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（先入为主是不对的！）|#0102Adv25_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:正门是锁着的。|#0102Adv25_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的话<br>让艾玛悄悄松了口气。|#0102Adv25_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对了，我还找到了这个。|#0102Adv25_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『スコップ』入手
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:铲子……？|#0102Adv25_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是放在清扫工具柜里面的。<br>好像是会定期更换。|#0102Adv25_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凶手可能就是用它挖洞<br>潜入了米莉亚的惩罚室！|#0102Adv25_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……但我印象中惩罚室里<br>好像没有什么洞吧。|#0102Adv25_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚刚还洋洋得意的汉娜<br>顿时变得垂头丧气。|#0102Adv25_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:那倒也是……|#0102Adv25_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:总、总之我再去找找看其他线索！<br>谢谢你汉娜！|#0102Adv25_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:搜查时间实在太短了。<br>艾玛有点担心垂头丧气的汉娜，<br>但也只能抛下她跑走了。|#0102Adv25_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

